    description: "Wave 5 PR #6 (selfh #166, commit 2c6f57dc6) folded Symbol.kind=route to kind=function + meta['framework_role']='route'. To keep existing framework YAMLs (phoenix.yaml, falcon.yaml, yesod.yaml, library-exports.yaml, …) working without forcing each to migrate, framework_patterns.py Pattern.matches() was extended at lines 396-401 (combined name+kind path, marked '# pragma: no cover' as no test exercises it) and 423-428 (kind-only path, covered by test_pattern_matches_symbol_kind) to fall back to meta['framework_role'] when symbol_kind regex doesn't match symbol.kind.\n\nThis is backward-compat technical debt. To remove the shim:\n\n1. Audit packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/frameworks/*.yaml for 'symbol_kind: ' rules that historically targeted folded role names (route, event_publisher, ipc_caller, websocket_endpoint, graphql_resolver, http_client, etc.).\n2. Add a 'framework_role:' Pattern field; migrate matching YAML rules.\n3. After all YAMLs migrate, remove the backward-compat fallback in framework_patterns.py:396-401 and :423-428. Drop the # pragma: no cover. Update test_pattern_matches_symbol_kind to use framework_role.\n\nRefs: ADR-0027 Phase 3 §'Resolution', audit-findings 0013, WI-runod schedule, WI-habut. Phase 4b registry cleanup (WI-butol) cannot fully complete until the YAMLs no longer reference deprecated symbol_kind values."  # 37eb
    fields: {}  # 37eb
